{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NVFguhAsvjgJW2Lq1yqhmE","type":"tool_result","content":"# Builds paper1/latex/main.pdf, the first full draft of paper 2.\n#   make          latexmk -pdf (pdflatex + bibtex as often as needed)\n#   make tables   regenerate tables/*.tex from the recorded CSVs\n#   make refs     check every DOI in refs.bib against Crossref / DataCite (cached)\n#   make axioms   every theorem the draft cites has a clean axiom line (needs lake build)\n#   make check    fail on undefined references or citations in the last build\n#   make clean    remove build products but the PDF\nall: main.pdf\n\nmain.pdf: main.tex $(wildcard sec*.tex) refs.bib $(wildcard tables/*.tex) $(wildcard ../figures/*.pdf)\n\tlatexmk -pdf -interaction=nonstopmode -halt-on-error main.tex\n\ntables:\n\tcd ../.. && python3 -m paper1.latex.make_tables\n\nrefs:\n\tcd ../.. && python3 -m paper1.latex.check_refs\n\naxioms:\n\tcd ../.. && python3 -m paper1.latex.check_axioms\n\ncheck: main.pdf\n\t@! grep -E \"undefined|Citation .* undefined|Reference .* undefined\" main.log\n\t@echo \"no undefined references; $$(pdfinfo main.pdf | grep Pages)\"\n\nclean:\n\tlatexmk -c\n\trm -f *.bbl *.blg *.synctex.gz\n\ndistclean: clean\nMakefile\nfigures\nmain.pdf\nmain.tex\nrefs.bib\nsec10_conclusion.tex\nsec11_data.tex\nsec12_ack.tex\nsec1_intro.tex\nsec2_statement.tex\nsec3_beyond.tex\nsec4_proof.tex\nsec5_replay.tex\nsec6_consequences.tex\nsec7_practitioner.tex\nsec8_lean.tex\nsec9_related.tex\nsecA_appendix_lean.tex\ntables\n5:% entries it fetches (comparator, nanoda, the human-audit paper's version).\n8:% ~/dev/untrusted/openai-math/preprints/The-Exponential-Time-Hypothesis-is-False-October-25-2026/README.md\n14:                  \\href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/main/preprints/The-Exponential-Time-Hypothesis-is-False-October-25-2026/paper.pdf}{OAI:The-Exponential-Time-Hypothesis-is-False-October-25-2026}},\n50:% The comparator mechanism the coll